_site/
_site_baseline/
data/parquet/
data/analytics/*.json
node_modules/
var/
.lycheecache
.boundaries-scratch/
# Former Git LFS directories: images are now served from CDN, not stored in this repo
images/
!src/**/images/
# Site chrome (banner, partner logos, range map, share card) is not photography —
# it lives in the repo and is served from public/, Vite's publicDir. Re-included
# explicitly so it does not have to be force-added past the rule above.
!public/images/
# Anchored: the ignore is for the top-level Zoomify tile staging directory that
# _instructions/ADDING_PLATE.md tells you to copy plates into. Unanchored, it also
# swallowed src/plates/ — the tracked .njk templates there survived only because
# they predate the rule, and any new file would have been silently untracked.
# Same trap the images/ rule above works around with its !src/**/images/ re-include.
/plates/
cdn-old-locations.txt
cdn-bad-slug-old-locations.txt

wwu-urls.txt
.env
.env.age
